OL,3,GNEWSAThousands helped with back to
OL,4,Aschool costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #310,000 has been given to
OL,7,Fhelp families with back to school
OL,8,Fcosts, the government has said.
OL,10,FIts Back to School Bonus was offered as
OL,11,Fa one-off payment of up to #150 towards
OL,12,Funiforms,b@/ stationeryb@/and other
OL,13,Fessentials for children from reception
OL,14,Fto Year 11 for families which earn less
OL,15,Fthan #75,000.
OL,17,FThe Social Security department said it
OL,18,Fhad approved 2,552 payments for 1,450
OL,19,Fprimary school pupils and 1,102
OL,20,Fsecondary school pupils for the start
OL,21,Fof the upcoming term.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
